	Indicator of whether 
fnref	smdc_rx_data
	should block if it attempts to read data when the channel is
	not ready. A non-zero value indicates that the function should
	block until the channel is ready. The value zero indicates that
	it should return immediately indicating that no data was read.
	Only valid when the
ref	cmd
	field is
ref	kSMDCRxCtlNotifyOnData.
